WEBVTT

00:01.910 --> 00:05.770
Sakisaki actually confronted me, 
and so sincerely.

00:07.400 --> 00:08.440
But...

00:09.250 --> 00:14.870
It's because we're friends that 
I can't tell her I like Mukai-kun.

00:18.610 --> 00:21.440
I just need to let go of Mukai-kun.

00:21.440 --> 00:22.570
That's all.

00:36.140 --> 00:38.720
There's no way you're 
gonna be able to let go.

00:41.520 --> 00:42.770
What?

00:43.080 --> 00:46.520
I mean, you're saying that now 
in the heat of the moment,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.670
but you're obviously gonna 
have second thoughts later.

00:51.190 --> 00:53.840
"Sakisaki's already agreed to the two-timing...

00:53.840 --> 00:56.950
Maybe she'd have accepted me 
like she did Minase-san!"

00:56.950 --> 00:57.950
Wha...

00:58.330 --> 01:01.910
"I should have asked for three-timing!"

01:01.910 --> 01:03.920
What a riot!

01:03.920 --> 01:05.500
Don't be stupid!

01:05.500 --> 01:06.890
I'm dead serious.

01:07.400 --> 01:09.290
I mean, you're a loser.

01:09.290 --> 01:11.060
That's totally what's gonna happen.

01:12.460 --> 01:16.650
Or, what, were you never 
that serious about Naoya?

01:16.650 --> 01:17.930
That's not it!

01:18.250 --> 01:25.890
Back when I met Mukai-kun in middle 
school, I fell for him right away.

01:26.440 --> 01:30.570
I was only holding back because
he already had Sakisaki.

01:30.570 --> 01:33.360
I was happy just being by him.

01:33.800 --> 01:37.340
I still cherish the picture 
I managed to get of him.

01:38.070 --> 01:43.290
And I've been using this ribbon 
he gave me for years!

01:43.880 --> 01:46.750
Naoya gave you that?! No fair!

01:46.750 --> 01:50.710
I chose my current high school 
because Mukai-kun's there!

01:50.710 --> 01:52.920
Yeah, you're definitely intense.

01:53.310 --> 01:59.380
Really, though, how are you going 
to give up on emotions that intense?

02:00.600 --> 02:01.780
I can do it.

02:02.260 --> 02:04.220
I'll delete Mukai-kun's picture!

02:04.220 --> 02:06.430
Send it to me before you do!

02:09.900 --> 02:11.650
<b>Delete?</b>

02:11.650 --> 02:12.360
<b>Deleted</b>

02:14.790 --> 02:16.070
The ribbon, too!

02:20.490 --> 02:21.860
The ribbon...

02:39.720 --> 02:40.920
Jeez.

02:40.920 --> 02:42.650
You're hopeless.

02:44.790 --> 02:48.300
You helped me get alone time with Naoya.

02:48.300 --> 02:49.860
I'll pay you back for that.

02:50.720 --> 02:52.220
Hoshizaki-san?

02:56.320 --> 02:58.650
Being in love is such a pain.

03:00.040 --> 03:03.130
I have no reason to support you.

03:03.880 --> 03:06.840
But even though I'm going to do my best,

03:06.840 --> 03:09.400
there's still no telling 
how things will end up.

03:10.160 --> 03:14.750
It'll be nice to have someone else 
around who's in the same boat.

03:19.090 --> 03:20.550
Let's keep at it.

03:21.970 --> 03:23.450
Hoshizaki-san...

03:24.300 --> 03:27.680
Though you're going to get 
rejected in the end either way.

03:27.680 --> 03:30.670
At the very least, you've got 
way less of a chance than me.

03:30.670 --> 03:32.730
But Hoshizaki-san, I—

03:33.630 --> 03:34.680
Shino-san!

03:38.280 --> 03:41.490
<b>Come here</b>

03:38.520 --> 03:41.490
Oh, I sent Naoya a message.

03:44.450 --> 03:49.660
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

03:44.450 --> 03:49.660
<b>I'm such a
 nice lady</b>

03:44.810 --> 03:46.620
Likability points!

03:46.620 --> 03:48.890
I'm such a nice lady.

03:51.270 --> 03:52.710
I was looking for you.

03:55.520 --> 03:56.710
Mukai-kun...

04:01.310 --> 04:02.930
Talk to me!

04:02.930 --> 04:04.090
Let me go!

04:04.090 --> 04:06.020
You're still hiding your feelings.

04:06.390 --> 04:08.760
Even I can guess what's going on!

04:10.220 --> 04:12.060
But I haven't told Saki-chan.

04:12.560 --> 04:17.450
I don't want to tell her how you
feel based on my own guess.

04:17.450 --> 04:19.070
I don't want to say it!

04:19.070 --> 04:21.190
I had the wrong idea.

04:21.730 --> 04:22.820
I got ahead of myself.

04:23.800 --> 04:25.450
And I made a mistake!

04:28.340 --> 04:32.910
I should never have done that!

04:33.800 --> 04:35.270
Shino...

04:38.350 --> 04:44.840
You're holding it all back for
 Saki-chan's sake, aren't you?

04:47.470 --> 04:48.600
But tell us anyway!

04:49.060 --> 04:50.560
Zero creativity!

04:50.860 --> 04:55.160
Think about how Saki-chan 
will feel if you just leave now!

04:55.160 --> 04:57.080
That's my line!

04:57.080 --> 05:00.150
Sakisaki's the one who's going 
to be upset if I speak up!

05:01.110 --> 05:02.820
Don't you understand, Mukai-kun?

05:02.820 --> 05:03.780
I do!

05:04.060 --> 05:08.490
It's not right for me to make you talk 
just to make things easier for me.

05:08.750 --> 05:10.950
That'll definitely cause issues!

05:10.950 --> 05:12.910
But I still don't want it to end like this!

05:12.910 --> 05:15.800
If I were someone who could do what's right,

05:15.800 --> 05:18.130
I never would've started 
two-timing in the first place!

05:18.130 --> 05:19.510
Good point!

05:21.220 --> 05:22.890
Why are you so persistent?

05:23.550 --> 05:26.810
Shino-san, wasn't it obvious when 
you fought with Saki-chan earlier

05:26.810 --> 05:30.510
how much she cares about you?

05:31.900 --> 05:33.700
You're my friend!

05:34.350 --> 05:37.500
You two care about each other so much!

05:37.500 --> 05:39.660
I don't want you to break up like this!

05:39.660 --> 05:43.200
There's no way you'll ruin everything 
just by telling the truth

05:43.200 --> 05:45.570
when you care so much!

05:45.570 --> 05:46.760
Stop it!

05:48.840 --> 05:51.000
No matter what happens...

05:51.490 --> 05:53.950
I promise to help!

05:54.300 --> 05:55.850
So please let us hear it.

05:56.360 --> 05:59.140
Let us hear what you've 
been hiding all this time!

05:59.140 --> 06:02.420
Let us hear what you were 
about to say last night!

06:02.700 --> 06:04.760
It won't be over until we hear it!

06:04.760 --> 06:06.340
I can't let it be over!

06:06.880 --> 06:09.830
Neither I nor Saki-chan!

06:14.520 --> 06:16.100
Nor can you!

06:17.900 --> 06:21.400
Please tell us why you're still 
holding on to that ribbon!

06:39.270 --> 06:42.080
Please let us hear it, Shino-san.

06:44.360 --> 06:49.000
I didn't want to trouble you or Sakisaki.

06:51.060 --> 06:57.370
I've been hiding my feelings for years.

06:58.820 --> 07:00.170
Shino...

07:01.130 --> 07:07.440
I knew I would be dragging it 
around with me forever.

07:07.960 --> 07:10.820
I'd already accepted it.

07:11.910 --> 07:13.670
Now I can't even hide that.

07:14.680 --> 07:16.260
I just worried you instead.

07:17.060 --> 07:19.160
And now look at how it's ended up.

07:20.760 --> 07:23.750
Sakisaki, I...

07:25.490 --> 07:28.870
I really...

07:35.720 --> 07:40.810
I'm someone whose boyfriend asked to 
two-time me, and all I did was smack him!

07:41.160 --> 07:46.020
No matter what you're hiding, 
the worst you'll ever get is a smack!

07:46.600 --> 07:48.410
So it'll be fine!

07:51.350 --> 07:52.780
Sakisaki...

07:55.430 --> 08:00.550
I have a crush on Mukai-kun.

08:01.940 --> 08:03.770
I always have.

08:09.420 --> 08:10.190
I'm sorry!

08:10.550 --> 08:13.010
Huh?!

08:14.500 --> 08:16.960
Wait, what? Huh?

08:16.960 --> 08:18.520
Shino, you like Naoya?

08:18.520 --> 08:19.970
Hang on, did you just reject her?!

08:20.450 --> 08:23.720
How dare you reject my dear friend?!

08:23.720 --> 08:25.690
Saki-san's confused!

08:25.690 --> 08:28.970
Also, you didn't see that coming?

08:30.280 --> 08:33.000
Actually, well, you see...

08:33.780 --> 08:36.700
I thought maybe she had a crush on me.

08:38.960 --> 08:44.330
I mean, you know, she seemed really nice to me.

08:44.330 --> 08:47.110
Obviously not.

08:50.160 --> 08:51.700
You're right.

08:53.940 --> 08:55.540
Okay, yeah...

08:57.130 --> 09:00.720
Even you liked Naoya.

09:02.180 --> 09:06.860
And for a long time, too.

09:09.310 --> 09:13.230
I'm so sorry I didn't realize!

09:13.230 --> 09:14.730
Sakisaki...

09:16.240 --> 09:17.610
Saki-chan...

09:18.130 --> 09:19.560
Saki-san...

09:23.350 --> 09:31.630
I'm so sorry I could never tell you!

09:31.630 --> 09:36.010
I forgive you!

09:36.010 --> 09:40.010
<b>Her Resolve, and...</b>

09:40.010 --> 09:43.990
She got rejected, like, a hundred times 
faster than I imagined, though.

09:40.010 --> 09:44.980
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

09:40.010 --> 09:44.980
<b>She got rejected, like,
100 times faster than
 I imagined, though...</b>

10:03.330 --> 10:04.700
Shino.

10:04.700 --> 10:06.720
M-Morning.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.150
Sakisaki.

10:08.150 --> 10:09.160
Morning.

10:09.780 --> 10:11.470
Sorry about everything yesterday.

10:11.470 --> 10:14.050
No, it doesn't matter anymore.

10:14.580 --> 10:20.330
If anything, I... d-don't really know what to say.

10:21.730 --> 10:24.060
I don't know what to say.

10:24.770 --> 10:26.730
Please stop walking on eggshells.

10:26.730 --> 10:29.440
Look how spectacularly 
she got rejected! Hilarious.

10:29.440 --> 10:31.060
Yeah, yeah, thank you.

10:31.060 --> 10:32.920
M-Mirika-san!

10:32.920 --> 10:35.120
She got ditched. No big deal.

10:35.120 --> 10:37.030
Could you be a little more...

10:37.030 --> 10:38.270
It's fine.

10:38.270 --> 10:40.310
It's true that I got rejected.

10:40.810 --> 10:43.660
A crush of several years. Just like that.

10:43.960 --> 10:45.370
<i>So awkward...</i>

10:45.370 --> 10:46.950
Lawl!

10:48.360 --> 10:50.790
I'll be heading home.

10:53.280 --> 10:54.510
I know, Naoya!

10:54.510 --> 10:55.250
What?

10:55.250 --> 10:57.760
Go cheer her up somehow!

10:57.760 --> 10:58.630
Got it!

10:58.630 --> 10:59.720
<i>That's it?!</i>

11:03.760 --> 11:06.430
I wanted to talk to you, too.

11:06.430 --> 11:07.640
So this is good.

11:09.780 --> 11:11.850
The summer's almost over.

11:12.870 --> 11:14.610
Yeah...

11:14.610 --> 11:18.410
I never thought my summer 
would end up like this.

11:19.960 --> 11:21.530
Shino-san...

11:22.240 --> 11:24.200
I'm really sorry!

11:24.490 --> 11:27.440
I forced you to confess in front of Saki-chan.

11:27.440 --> 11:28.810
And then I rejected you.

11:29.330 --> 11:31.670
I must have really hurt you.

11:31.670 --> 11:35.630
I'll do everything I can to make sure things 
aren't awkward between you and Saki-chan!

11:37.520 --> 11:38.790
Mukai-kun.

11:45.140 --> 11:47.010
I like you.

11:55.430 --> 11:58.070
I like how you're always so diligent.

11:59.010 --> 12:01.660
I like how you never give up on things.

12:02.700 --> 12:06.370
I like how you look at me directly.

12:07.030 --> 12:09.400
I like how you like Sakisaki.

12:09.910 --> 12:11.380
I like your eyes.

12:12.410 --> 12:15.550
I kinda hate that you're two-timing, though.

12:16.900 --> 12:21.630
But I just couldn't help 
wanting to be by your side.

12:21.630 --> 12:23.560
Shino-san...

12:26.930 --> 12:30.310
I wanted to tell you properly 
when it was just the two of us.

12:31.300 --> 12:35.770
I'm sorry I can't reciprocate your feelings.

12:36.680 --> 12:40.550
Would you mind telling me why?

12:42.680 --> 12:45.770
Because I want to make 
Saki-chan and Minase-san happy.

12:47.750 --> 12:49.680
I figured.

12:49.680 --> 12:50.650
Sorry.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.870
It's okay. Thanks.

12:53.960 --> 12:55.990
I feel better, to be honest.

12:57.130 --> 12:58.150
But that means...

12:59.430 --> 13:05.770
If you can make the two of them happy, 
and you still have the capacity...

13:08.320 --> 13:11.560
I have a shot too, then?

13:16.810 --> 13:19.310
I-I guess that's how it works?

13:19.310 --> 13:20.770
Hey, Naoya!

13:20.770 --> 13:22.730
Wait, Shino, what?!

13:22.730 --> 13:26.020
Sorry, I know I got rejected really hard.

13:26.660 --> 13:29.260
I know I'm a complete idiot.

13:30.700 --> 13:38.220
But now that I know it doesn't help anyone 
if I just hold back and hide my feelings...

13:39.410 --> 13:40.380
I...

13:41.840 --> 13:46.300
I want to become Mukai-kun's girlfriend, too!

13:53.220 --> 13:55.230
What do you think, Sakisaki?

13:55.230 --> 13:58.410
If it's an absolute no, 
I'll try my best to move on.

13:58.410 --> 13:59.530
U-Um....

13:59.530 --> 14:01.160
But if it's all right...

14:01.160 --> 14:03.070
W-Wait, this is so sudden!

14:03.070 --> 14:05.780
Wh-What am I supposed to say?!

14:07.240 --> 14:09.740
Could you please give it some thought, then?

14:10.850 --> 14:13.500
I won't give up until then.

14:16.560 --> 14:19.170
Well, I'll be off, then.

14:25.090 --> 14:26.060
<i>Are...</i>

14:27.480 --> 14:30.260
<i>Are you serious?</i>

14:30.800 --> 14:34.760
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

14:30.800 --> 14:34.760
<b>I said it...</b>

14:31.620 --> 14:33.110
I said it.

14:36.730 --> 14:39.610
I'm falling, Naoya! Help me!

14:37.080 --> 14:40.190
<i>We are now landing at Haneda.</i>

14:52.530 --> 14:53.580
Wh-What do we do?!

14:53.580 --> 14:53.960
Eh?!

14:53.960 --> 14:54.740
Finally?!

14:54.740 --> 14:57.320
Well, not only did it turn out 
Shino has a crush on you,

14:57.320 --> 14:59.370
she's refusing to move on and 
asking to be three-timed instead!

14:59.370 --> 15:00.890
Of course I'm flustered!

15:00.890 --> 15:02.710
Y-You're right.

15:02.710 --> 15:04.780
Is it really <i>our</i> Shino 
asking to be three-timed?

15:04.780 --> 15:06.860
What's wrong with her? Am I right?

15:08.000 --> 15:09.830
Um...

15:10.180 --> 15:11.640
<b>Asked for
 two-timing</b>

15:11.640 --> 15:14.600
I asked the wrong person!

15:14.600 --> 15:16.160
Calm down, Saki-chan!

15:16.160 --> 15:18.060
I can't!

15:18.930 --> 15:21.020
What are you doing, 
screaming in front of the door?

15:21.020 --> 15:22.220
You're so noisy.

15:22.220 --> 15:23.360
Shino!

15:23.360 --> 15:24.700
Shino-san...

15:25.320 --> 15:26.650
Mukai-kun.

15:27.320 --> 15:33.240
<b>Thump</b>

15:27.320 --> 15:33.240
<b>Thump</b>

15:27.620 --> 15:30.040
I was waiting at home with some sweets I made.

15:30.770 --> 15:32.310
Would you try them for me?

15:33.240 --> 15:35.520
I-I don't mind, but...

15:35.520 --> 15:36.450
Really?!

15:36.530 --> 15:40.410
<b>Thump</b>

15:36.530 --> 15:40.410
<b>Thump</b>

15:38.080 --> 15:40.410
<b>Thump</b>

15:38.280 --> 15:39.540
I'm so glad.

15:38.660 --> 15:40.410
<b>Thump</b>

15:40.410 --> 15:41.960
You're so cute!

15:41.960 --> 15:43.080
Never mind that...

15:43.080 --> 15:44.010
Shino?!

15:44.010 --> 15:46.520
I'll make sure I don't get in your way.

15:46.520 --> 15:48.250
In fact, I'll support you.

15:49.890 --> 15:51.630
Oh, Mukai-kun...

15:51.630 --> 15:53.090
<b>Foundational
 Classic Grammar</b>

15:53.390 --> 15:55.820
I'm going to help you study this time.

15:56.240 --> 16:00.080
You're gonna need to study plenty 
if you want to pull off two-timing.

16:00.080 --> 16:02.060
T-True...

16:02.350 --> 16:05.020
I'm still the top of our grade!

16:05.020 --> 16:06.560
Thank you!

16:06.560 --> 16:07.480
Naoya!

16:08.390 --> 16:09.720
Thanks.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.050
Ask me anytime.

16:12.070 --> 16:17.410
<b>Thump</b>

16:12.070 --> 16:17.410
<b>Thump</b>

16:12.070 --> 16:17.410
<b>Thump</b>

16:12.790 --> 16:17.410
I'll stay up all night to help you 
every step of the way.

16:17.410 --> 16:19.870
That sounds hot!

16:19.870 --> 16:21.790
Hey, don't make it weird!

16:23.750 --> 16:25.320
Definitely hot!

16:26.250 --> 16:28.460
Wh-What are you talking about?

16:29.280 --> 16:30.390
But...

16:31.010 --> 16:39.890
<b>Thump</b>

16:31.010 --> 16:39.890
<b>Thump</b>

16:31.010 --> 16:39.890
<b>Thump</b>

16:31.010 --> 16:39.890
<b>Thump</b>

16:31.750 --> 16:37.420
I-If you insist, Mukai-kun... I could...

16:37.420 --> 16:39.350
It's nothing but hotness!

16:40.220 --> 16:42.750
Naoya, what are you going to do?

16:42.750 --> 16:44.750
W-Well...

16:44.750 --> 16:47.600
I'm going to support the three of you.

16:47.600 --> 16:50.360
I'm not going to steal him like Hoshizaki-san.

16:50.840 --> 16:56.820
You can think about me after 
you bring these two happiness.

16:56.820 --> 16:59.230
I can't think of a reason to refuse.

16:59.230 --> 17:00.790
I get that.

17:00.790 --> 17:04.000
Still, though, are you serious, Shino?

17:04.000 --> 17:05.350
I'm serious.

17:06.060 --> 17:08.320
I do think it's idiotic.

17:08.320 --> 17:11.610
And I think it's wrong, socially and morally.

17:12.170 --> 17:14.940
I've been talking down on 
two-timing all this time, too.

17:16.010 --> 17:18.090
But I still like you.

17:20.260 --> 17:25.660
Even if I can't have you to myself, 
I still want to be by your side.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.280
Shino...

17:29.310 --> 17:30.740
Shino-san...

17:31.810 --> 17:34.300
I'm sorry, Sakisaki.

17:34.300 --> 17:37.200
N-No, er..

17:37.800 --> 17:42.700
Also, Minase-san, I've been lashing out at you.

17:43.830 --> 17:48.600
But I'm sure this is how you must have felt, too.

17:50.920 --> 17:55.430
To be honest, I was just jealous of you.

17:56.260 --> 17:57.720
I'm sorry.

18:00.180 --> 18:02.330
P-Please raise your head.

18:02.330 --> 18:03.740
Got a good pic.

18:06.520 --> 18:08.720
Looks like you're serious.

18:08.720 --> 18:10.770
Saki-chan, what should we do?

18:10.770 --> 18:12.120
There's nothing I can do!

18:12.120 --> 18:12.920
Ignore!

18:12.920 --> 18:13.980
Makes sense!

18:13.980 --> 18:18.750
Well, then, I expect to be amused, Sir Shino.

18:18.750 --> 18:19.900
Sakisaki...

18:21.520 --> 18:23.750
Thanks. I'll do my best.

18:27.800 --> 18:32.010
I'll do anything to make sure 
your two-timing works out.

18:32.910 --> 18:34.480
I'll help you study.

18:34.480 --> 18:36.340
And don't worry about your finances.

18:36.340 --> 18:38.220
She's the type that ruins men!

18:38.660 --> 18:40.220
So, well...

18:40.600 --> 18:43.280
I'm going to be at odds 
with you, Hoshizaki-san,

18:43.280 --> 18:45.430
since you prefer to have him to yourself.

18:46.280 --> 18:47.740
Suit yourself.

18:48.140 --> 18:51.980
Oh, I forgot to ask...

18:52.960 --> 18:57.370
What's the thing you said 
you should have never done?

18:57.370 --> 18:59.430
You made a mistake or something?

19:02.620 --> 19:05.580
Th-Th-That's...

19:07.040 --> 19:10.250
U-U-Um...

19:10.250 --> 19:11.500
Er, well...

19:12.880 --> 19:13.960
What?

19:14.480 --> 19:15.980
What did you do?

19:21.090 --> 19:22.980
So, Shino...

19:23.440 --> 19:26.390
What did you do in Okinawa?

19:26.850 --> 19:28.440
U-Um...

19:28.440 --> 19:30.040
Saki-chan, relax.

19:30.040 --> 19:31.280
How could I?

19:31.280 --> 19:33.560
She did something she can't even speak about!

19:33.840 --> 19:35.570
I know what she did.

19:35.570 --> 19:36.520
What?!

19:36.520 --> 19:38.480
I'll say it!

19:40.500 --> 19:44.440
When I was alone with Mukai-kun 
on the deserted island...

19:46.150 --> 19:48.700
I got too excited, and...

19:49.650 --> 19:53.170
I kissed him.

19:55.720 --> 19:56.900
While I was naked.

19:57.800 --> 19:59.210
I pushed him down.

20:09.720 --> 20:11.980
S-Saki-ch—

20:12.600 --> 20:15.520
You kissed her

20:16.810 --> 20:18.270
before

20:18.270 --> 20:20.980
me?!

20:22.240 --> 20:24.720
You'd already laid a hand on her?

20:22.450 --> 20:28.280
<b>Whack</b>

20:22.900 --> 20:28.280
<b>Smack</b>

20:24.720 --> 20:26.990
You filthy man!

20:26.990 --> 20:28.670
No, Sakisaki!

20:28.670 --> 20:30.810
I snuck up on him!

20:30.810 --> 20:33.210
It's not his fault!

20:33.210 --> 20:35.600
So you're the filthy one!

20:33.250 --> 20:35.420
<b>Squeeze</b>

20:35.600 --> 20:37.420
I have no excuse!

20:37.420 --> 20:40.730
How could you?!

20:39.570 --> 20:41.890
I-I'm sorry.

20:41.890 --> 20:47.040
It could have been really bad 
if I hadn't already kissed him!

20:42.280 --> 20:44.860
There, there, Naoya...

20:47.040 --> 20:48.010
Yes...

20:48.010 --> 20:50.760
Mirika-san kissed him first...

20:51.560 --> 20:54.390
And Shino-san and Saki-san did...

20:56.420 --> 21:02.320
I guess I'm the only one who 
hasn't kissed Naoya-kun yet.

21:02.570 --> 21:04.080
Beg forgiveness!

21:04.080 --> 21:05.820
I'm sorry!

21:06.220 --> 21:07.790
How do you intend to make this right?

21:07.790 --> 21:10.590
I-I'll do anything I can.

21:10.590 --> 21:11.320
What?!

21:11.320 --> 21:13.790
Then would you wear a 
maid bikini if I told you to?

21:13.790 --> 21:15.790
Huh? I w-would...

21:15.790 --> 21:19.820
Nagisa-chan, the attacker is expressing 
good faith. What shall we do?

21:20.920 --> 21:23.260
I think we can forgive her!

21:23.840 --> 21:25.610
It's fine.

21:26.220 --> 21:32.700
I just didn't want Naoya-kun so 
desperately that I would act out of turn.

21:32.270 --> 21:36.440
<b>Shudder</b>

21:32.270 --> 21:36.440
<b>Shudder</b>

21:33.520 --> 21:36.440
I messed up. I was a fool.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.980
Console her!

21:37.980 --> 21:40.900
Trying to get ahead is absolutely unacceptable!

21:40.900 --> 21:44.920
You were holding back on kissing him 
for Sakisaki's sake, weren't you?

21:44.920 --> 21:45.930
Really?!

21:45.930 --> 21:47.660
I think you're extremely kind!

21:47.660 --> 21:48.650
I admire you!

21:48.650 --> 21:49.620
Crazy!

21:50.060 --> 21:52.060
Well, in any case...

21:52.060 --> 21:53.080
Mirika?

21:54.660 --> 21:57.820
You're his girlfriend, 
and you're still hesitating.

21:57.820 --> 22:00.360
You're never going to get a chance to kiss him.

22:01.500 --> 22:04.960
How are you so heartless?!

22:04.960 --> 22:07.360
I'm sure you'll kiss him someday, Nagisa-chan.

22:07.360 --> 22:09.180
Yeah, for sure!

22:09.180 --> 22:10.810
You've got big boobs!

22:10.810 --> 22:12.060
And you're cute!

22:12.060 --> 22:13.720
Even I got to kiss him!

22:13.720 --> 22:16.310
I'm not even his girlfriend, and <i>I</i> kissed him!

22:16.310 --> 22:18.980
Why don't you go ahead and kiss him now?

22:18.980 --> 22:20.520
G-Great idea!

22:20.520 --> 22:23.760
But that won't mean anything.

22:23.760 --> 22:24.810
Nah.

22:24.810 --> 22:27.340
A kiss is a kiss in any situation.

22:27.340 --> 22:28.490
Y-You're right.

22:28.490 --> 22:34.450
A-Although, my kiss with Naoya 
just happened to work out nicely.

22:34.450 --> 22:39.170
M-Mine ended up being dramatic, too, but...

22:39.470 --> 22:41.750
It's really nothing, though!

22:44.240 --> 22:45.640
<i>You guys suck at this.</i>

22:50.430 --> 23:01.900
<b>Shudder
Shudder</b>

22:52.360 --> 22:58.620
I'm going to share a beautiful kiss 
with Naoya-kun someday soon.

22:58.620 --> 23:01.220
I'm fine.

23:01.900 --> 23:03.360
She's mad!

23:03.750 --> 23:05.910
Minase-san...

23:05.910 --> 23:07.420
What was that?

23:07.420 --> 23:09.320
I was just...

23:10.280 --> 23:13.000
You're so cute when you're upset!

23:13.000 --> 23:14.490
Thank you.

23:14.490 --> 23:17.880
Thank <i>you</i>! I should be thanking <i>you</i>!

23:16.700 --> 23:20.140
Whew, I guess that solves that.

23:17.880 --> 23:19.260
Naoya-kun!

23:19.260 --> 23:21.900
It was so cute! I want to see it again!

23:20.990 --> 23:22.890
What do you mean, "Whew"?

23:21.900 --> 23:23.390
Please forget you saw that!

23:23.390 --> 23:25.880
Let's make it a dramatic kiss!

23:26.390 --> 23:28.980
I'll book somewhere romantic!
